      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为结果上色但保留其色调，可做棕褐或蓝晒效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put each pixel's brightness back afterwards, so only the color moves": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随后将每个像素的亮度还原，仅让颜色变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the background behind a layer mask, keeping the foreground subjects. The pixels stay, so the background can be painted back at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用图层蒙版隐藏背景、保留前景主体。像素仍在，因此随时可把背景画回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Basic is quick; Advanced refines the mask against the layer's own detail, for hair and fur": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本模式较快；高级模式依据图层自身细节优化蒙版，适用于毛发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pull the mask onto the image's own edges, which recovers hair and fur": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将蒙版贴合图像自身边缘，可恢复毛发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shrink the mask to drop the rim of background color around the subject, or grow it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收缩蒙版以去掉主体周围的背景色边，或将其扩大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill the selection using surrounding pixels from this layer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用本图层周围像素填充选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distribution": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uniform": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "统一"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gaussian": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高斯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Monochromatic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the vignette color": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择暗角颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protect bright areas near the edge": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保护靠近边缘的高光区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Positive straightens lines that bow outward (barrel); negative, lines that bow inward (pincushion).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正值时校正外鼓的线条（桶形）；负值时校正内凹的线条（枕形）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limited to the selection": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限于选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make each dithered pixel this many pixels across, for a chunky old-screen look": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让每个抖动像素为此大小的方块，呈现粗犷的老屏幕质感"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行文字的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序任意：每个点取墨色最贴近其色调的那个字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tones per channel: 2 is pure black and white": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每通道色调数：2 为纯黑白"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向邻近扩散的程度。值小则区域更平整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More ink (darker) or less before dithering": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抖动前墨色更多（更暗）或更少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colors": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dark": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixel Shape": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像素形状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw each chunky pixel as a solid square, or as a round dot like a dot-matrix screen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将每个粗像素画成实心方块，或点阵屏那样的圆点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light on Dark": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暗底亮字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw the marks for the light tones on the dark color, like a glowing screen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在暗色上绘制亮调的标记，如同发光的屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕线条的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线填充间隙的比例；较暗处线条更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light blooming around the lines, like a CRT's phosphors": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条周围的光晕，如同 CRT 荧光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break the lines into beads where the picture is darker than this, blending into solid lines where it's brighter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图像比此更暗处将线条断开成珠状，在更亮处融合为实线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lift the lines where the picture is bright, or lower them when negative, so they swell into its shapes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图像明亮处抬升线条，或为负时压低，使其鼓入图像形状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度在位移线条前的平滑程度，从锐利山脊到圆润丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw no line where the picture is darker than this, leaving the screen dark": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像比此更暗处不绘线，使屏幕保持黑暗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the lines waver sideways down the screen, like a CRT losing sync": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让线条沿屏幕向下左右摆动，如同 CRT 失去同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the red and blue apart, for colored fringes on the lines": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将红蓝分开，使线条出现彩色边缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Darker or lighter before the lines are drawn": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绘制线条前更暗或更亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像为黑时线条的亮度，使其在黑底上仍可见"
